chords | r/2 [eb4,g4,bb4]' [ab3,c4,eb4]' | r/2 [eb4,g4,bb4]' [bb3,d4,ab4]' | r/2 [bb3,d4,ab4]' [bb3,d4,ab4]' | r/2 [eb4,g4,bb4]' [eb4,g4,bb4]' |
drums  | Z/2 r/4       | r/6           | r/6           | r/6           |

