chords | r/2 [eb4,g4,bb4]' [ab3,c4,eb4]' | r/2 [ab3,c4,eb4]' [eb4,g4,bb4]' | r/2 [bb3,d4,ab4]' [bb3,d4,ab4]' | r/2 [bb3,d4,f4]' [bb3,d4,f4]' |
drums  | r/6           | r/6           | r/6           | r/6           |

