chords | r/2 [eb4,g4,bb4]' [eb4,g4,bb4]' | r/2 [eb4,g4,bb4]' [eb4,g4,bb4]' | r/2 [f3,ab3,c4]' [f3,ab3,c4]' | r/2 [eb4,g4,bb4]' [eb4,g4,bb4]' |
drums  | r/6           | r/6           | r/6           | r/6           |

